==Trivia==
*Nimoy Bore's name, description and appearance all heavily reference ''Star Trek''<nowiki/>'s [[wikipedia:Spock|Spock]] along with his first real-life actor, [[wikipedia:Leonard Nimoy|Leonard Nimoy]].
**His Japanese name (イノヴァルカン ''Inovarukan'', Inovulcan) also references Spock's species, the [[wikipedia:Vulcan (Star Trek)|Vulcans]], combining it with 猪 ''inoshishi'' (wild boar).
*Nimoy Bore is bald and wears a wig, which can be observed if he gets frozen mid-attack or by looking at his spritesheet.
*Nimoy Bore and [[Cli-One]]'s IDs are the reverse of when they're introduced: Nimoy Bore is 179 while Cli-One is 178.

